{"id":"b244db7d9d164dbe","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration.md","title":"ZFC Model7 Well Founded Iteration","display":"df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration — ZFC Model7 Well Founded Iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration"],"display":"df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration — ZFC Model7 Well Founded Iteration","depends_on":["[[58-df-well-founded]]","[[58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration — ZFC Model7 Well Founded Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cf48057cf33acf4\" href=\"?note=9cf48057cf33acf4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,M,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal T,M,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cf48057cf33acf4\" href=\"?note=9cf48057cf33acf4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl({}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,M,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\!\\left(\\in\\cap\\vec{\\mathcal M}(\\alpha)^2,\\vec{\\mathcal M}(\\alpha)\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl({}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,M,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\!\\left(\\in\\cap\\vec{\\mathcal M}(\\alpha)^2,\\vec{\\mathcal M}(\\alpha)\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The root model and the actual model sequence are tied to the canonical six-place iteration-tree code, whose upstream definition already makes the model sequence a function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>. No unsupported projections <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta^{\\mathcal T}\">\\(\\theta^{\\mathcal T}\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}\">\\(M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}\\)</span> remain, and no circular codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal M})\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal M})\\)</span> is used to reassert functionhood.</li>\n<li>The exact two-place well-foundedness predicate is imposed on the membership relation and carrier of every iterate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"9cf48057cf33acf4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"9cf48057cf33acf4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-model7-iteration-tree]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-well-founded]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T,M,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl({}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,M,\\theta)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\!\\left(\\in\\cap\\vec{\\mathcal M}(\\alpha)^2,\\vec{\\mathcal M}(\\alpha)\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta^{\\mathcal T}","display":false},{"tex":"M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathcal M})","display":false}],"bytes":1728,"backlinks":[{"id":"3ea3dede2645310a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2791","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration.md|58-df-zfc-model7-well-founded-iteration]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["9e70b896da231f4f","9cf48057cf33acf4"]}